    short: 'Premature integration of buyer and target before antitrust clearance — prohibited under EUMR, HSR, and equivalent regimes.',
    extended: '<p>The exchange of competitively sensitive information (or actual operational integration) between buyer and target before antitrust clearance has issued. Until clearance, the parties remain independent competitors and cannot exchange pricing data, customer lists, or strategic plans. Penalties under the EU Merger Regulation, the U.S. Hart-Scott-Rodino Act, and equivalent regimes are substantial. The buyer\'s antitrust counsel will run a "clean team" arrangement for any necessary information exchange.</p>',
    juris: ['eu', 'us', 'uk'],
    modules: ['09', '10'],
